@startuml
!include _seq-style.puml
title 3.6.9 CloseShift

actor "Cashier" as C
boundary "POS UI" as UI <<boundary>>

== Close shift ==
note over UI
  No close-shift API. Flutter: enter closing cash,\nsummarize and clear/lock local ShiftSession.
end note
C -> UI: enter closing cash, confirm close
activate UI
UI -> UI: compute variance, save shift report
UI --> C: lock sales until new shift
deactivate UI

@enduml
